OL,3,ASchools to close early again for A66
OL,4,Acrash funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of schools will close early
OL,7,Fagain due to a funeral for one of the
OL,8,Fyoung men who died in a crash which
OL,9,Fkilled seven people, including two
OL,10,Fpolice officers.
OL,12,FTheo Rae, 17, was among the five in the
OL,13,Fcar which went the wrong way down the
OL,14,FA66 near Middlesbrough in the early
OL,15,Fhours of 22 August and hit an oncoming
OL,16,FCleveland Police vehicle.
OL,18,FMiddlesbrough Council said a number of
OL,19,Fschools had chosen to close for the
OL,20,Fteenager's funeral, including a primary
OL,21,Fschool which said it would "ensure safe
OL,22,Ftransit home for all our families".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
