OL,3,ASchools to close early again for A66
OL,4,Acrash funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools in neighbouring South Bank
OL,7,Fclosed early on Friday for Jakub
OL,8,FMatusiak's funeral. Police said it
OL,9,F"passed without issue" and with "very
OL,10,Fminimal traffic disruption".
